Merlin: Greetings! You found Merlin!
Student: What's Merlin?
Merlin: Merlin is a majestic oak tree!
Student: What makes it so special?
Merlin: It's the oldest tree on campus. It was here when Valparasio University began!
Student: I bet it's seen a lot.
Merlin: Yes! And students and visitors still enjoy the shelter of its branches. Now you have too!
=> END